OL,3,GNEWSALocals left shaken after discovery
OL,4,Aof man's body
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Peterborough neighbourhood has spoken
OL,7,Fof its shock at the discovery of a
OL,8,Fman's body on a suburban street.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire Police were called to
OL,11,FCampion Road in Dogsthorpe at about
OL,12,F07:15 BST on Monday. Officers said the
OL,13,Fdeath of the man, believed to be in his
OL,14,F60s, is being treated as suspicious.
OL,16,FOfficers have remained in the area on
OL,17,FWednesday carrying out enquiries in
OL,18,Fnearby Broom Close.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
