OL,3,GNEWSALocals left shaken after discovery
OL,4,Aof man's body
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Johnson, who lives nearby, said:
OL,7,F"When you hear about things like this
OL,8,Fit's normally on the news, but when it
OL,9,Fcomes to your own community, it makes
OL,10,Fyou sit up and take notice. It's
OL,11,Fshocking, to say the least."
